# Architecture

Full rules: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)

Hard constraints (do not duplicate lists elsewhere):

- Dependency: `SharedKernel <- Domain <- Application <- Infrastructure <- Api`
- Custom `IDispatcher` only — no MediatR
- `Result` for expected failures; `TypedResults` in endpoints
- `IOptions<T>` for config — no magic config keys
- Pipeline and middleware order are fixed in AGENTS.md — do not reorder
- `IUnitOfWork` = `SaveChangesAsync` only; no Outbox in v1
- Query handlers: no `ICacheService` / `HybridCache` / `DbContext`
